            "text": "The fraud detection model leverages machine learning algorithms and data augmentation techniques to address imbalanced datasets. Key components include:\n- **Algorithm Selection**: Logistic Regression, KNN, SVM, Naïve Bayes, Decision Trees, Random Forests, Gradient Boosting, and Stacked Generalization.\n- **Class Imbalance Handling**: Techniques like SMOTE (Synthetic Minority Over-Sampling Technique) and SMOTENC (SMOTE for categorical features) are employed to balance datasets.\n- **Experimental Setup**: Emphasis on hyperparameter tuning, model evaluation, and scalability for real-world applications.",
